FMAC, FIPR and FTRV in float unless -DDREAM_FPU_DOUBLE=1 (then upstream fused/double). The
float block is byte-identical to patches/dream-recomp-pc/0002 so PC and PSP run the same code;
both sides build with -ffp-contract=off (no implicit FMA). Applies after 0006 (perf counters).

Denormal inputs, products and sums are flushed to signed zero in software (x86 FTZ+DAZ does
that in hardware for PC; PPSSPP keeps denormals).

